<title>USA: Chic by HIS Q2 net includes gain.</title>
<headline>Chic by HIS Q2 net includes gain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.93   profit	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net profit		 9,070   profit	   675</p>
<p> Revs			66,442		   84,344</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,796		    9,754</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.86     loss	 $1.34</p>
<p> Net profit		 8,346     loss	13,097</p>
<p> Revs		     122,473		  155,173</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,754		    9,754</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods ended May 3, 1997, and May 4, 1996.</p>
<p>1997 Q2 and six-month periods include a gain of $34.1 million from the sale of subsidiary stock.</p>
<p>1997 six-month period includes charge of $330,000.</p>
<p>1996 six-month period includes a $15 million restructuring charge.</p>
